{"id":"7b84643546529bb184f682663494e8f45b9724bb","axis":"silent","repo":"elgg/Elgg","sha":"7b84643546529bb184f682663494e8f45b9724bb","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"docs/appendix/upgrade-notes/7.0-to-7.1.rst","lines":["@@ -27,6 +27,16 @@ Because of the introduction of the generic entity controller the following resou","  * ``resources/pages/view``","  * ``resources/thewire/view``"," ","+Generic filter menu items","+-------------------------","+","+The generic menu items registered to the default filter menu, like 'All', 'Mine', 'Friends', no longer show on pages with","+an owner different from the logged in user. The event handler for the 'All' and 'Mine' menu items has been split into ","+2 separate event handlers.","+","+Passing custom `elgg_view_page()` variables ('all_link', 'mine_link' and 'friend_link') have been deprecated.","+We encourage developers to leverage the generic route names for these kinds of pages.","+"," Deprecated Views"," ----------------"," "],"additions":10,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"docs/guides/events-list.rst","lines":["@@ -179,9 +179,9 @@ System events"," \tIf ``filter_id`` is ``filter`` (the default) then the ``all``, ``mine`` and ``friends`` tabs will be generated base on some provided information"," \tor be tried for routes similar to the current route."," \t","-\t- params['all_link'] will be used for the ``all`` tab","-\t- params['mine_link'] will be used for the ``mine`` tab","-\t- params['friends_link'] will be used for the ``friend`` tab","+\t- params['all_link'] will be used for the ``all`` tab (deprecated)","+\t- params['mine_link'] will be used for the ``mine`` tab (deprecated)","+\t- params['friend_link'] will be used for the ``friend`` tab (deprecated)"," \t"," \tIf the above are not provided than a route will be tried based on ``params['entity_type']`` and ``params['entity_subtype']``."," \tIf not provided ``entity_type`` and ``entity_subtype`` will be based on route detection of the current route. "],"additions":3